%% Figure 3.2: Processing flow used for a standard citizen report.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Citizen
    participant Identity as Identity simulator
    participant Relayer
    participant AI as AI aggregator
    participant IPFS
    participant Chain as Reporting contract

    Citizen->>Identity: Request signed one-use tickets
    Identity-->>Citizen: Return ticket batch and citizen seed
    Citizen->>Relayer: Submit signed report and media
    Relayer->>Relayer: Verify ticket, hashes, and signature
    Relayer->>AI: Request moderation
    AI-->>Relayer: Return decision and processed media
    Relayer->>IPFS: Store accepted complaint envelope
    IPFS-->>Relayer: Return CID
    Relayer->>Chain: Submit report record
    Relayer-->>Citizen: Stream processing status
